<\/ul>","button_url":"","button_text":""}},"item_GRBjAC":{"type":"item","disabled":true,"settings":{"image_rotation_degrees":1.5,"subheading":"","title":"Heading 2","content":"<p>Use this text to share information about your brand with your customers. Describe a product, share announcements, or welcome customers to your store.<\/p>","button_url":"","button_text":""}}},"block_order":["item_XybWJt","item_GRBjAC"],"name":"Multiple images with text","settings":{"full_width":true,"images_layout":"stacked","collage_images_alignment":"top","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":"","button_background":"","button_text_color":""}},"tabs_pPhxin":{"type":"tabs","blocks":{"tab_pV8ax4":{"type":"tab","settings":{"title":"① 設置設計","content":"<h4>店舗図面と店内写真をもとに、<br\/>最適なセンサー設置位置を設計します。<\/h4>","page":""}},"tab_jJrhNT":{"type":"tab","settings":{"title":"② 設置・調整","content":"<h4>営業時間外に設置を行い、<br\/>設置当日および翌営業日に精度調整を行います。<\/h4>","page":""}},"tab_JhxMxJ":{"type":"tab","settings":{"title":"③ データ連携","content":"<h4>POS・シフト・各種データを連携し、<br\/>コンバージョンなどの指標を算出します。<\/h4>","page":""}},"tab_xxDhmN":{"type":"tab","settings":{"title":"④ 利用開始","content":"<h4>ストアから本部まで、<br\/>すべての関係者がデータを活用できます。<\/h4>","page":""}}},"block_order":["tab_pV8ax4","tab_jJrhNT","tab_JhxMxJ","tab_xxDhmN"],"name":"Tabs","settings":{"full_width":true,"content_size":"large","subheading":"短期間で運用を開始できます。","title":"導入はシンプルです。","text_alignment":"center","first_tab_open":true,"background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":"","heading_color":"","heading_gradient":"linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(160, 184, 66, 1), rgba(0, 0, 0, 1) 100%)"}},"image_with_text_overlay_yPDKdw":{"type":"image-with-text-overlay","blocks":{"subheading_YHgEN8":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":"データの取り扱い"}},"heading_xb6y3T":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"個人を識別・保存する仕組みではありません。","heading_tag":"h1"}},"richtext_gJNFdW":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>FlowのAIカメラは、個人を識別・記録するものではありません。<\/p><p>映像は処理後に保持されず、個人を特定する情報は取得しません。<\/p><p>店舗運営に必要な統計データのみを扱います。<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["subheading_YHgEN8","heading_xb6y3T","richtext_gJNFdW"],"name":"Image with text overlay","settings":{"full_width":true,"allow_transparent_header":false,"enable_parallax":false,"image_size":"sm","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Case_Study_Banner_2d55c6df-b48b-4a05-8c47-8aa8b4abc8eb.png","mobile_text_position":"place-self-center text-center","desktop_text_position":"sm:place-self-center sm:text-center","text_color":"#ffffff","overlay_color":"#000000","overlay_opacity":48}},"faq_nWrMQU":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"item_cHEGLy":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"精度はどの程度ですか？","content":"<p>精度は店舗の環境によって異なります。ただし、全店舗の平均精度は95%を超えています。<\/p><p>設置設計と調整により、動作が最適化されています。<\/p>"}},"item_KCwfeG":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"どのようなデータが取得できますか？","content":"<p>来店数、店前通行量、滞在時間、属性、店内導線などを取得できます。<\/p>"}},"item_C6DPXx":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"スタッフはカウントに含まれますか？","content":"<p>システムは、スタッフや同一日の来店客を識別し、計測から除外するよう最適化が可能です。<\/p><p>これにより、より実態に近いコンバージョンデータを取得できます。<\/p>"}},"item_cf6HbK":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"来店計測の映像は保存されますか？","content":"<p>保存されません。<br\/>個人を特定する情報は取得しません。<\/p>"}},"item_4Xf6eC":{"type":"item","settings":{"title":"AIカメラだけで効果は出ますか？","content":"<p>測定だけでは効果は限定的です。<br\/>データを活用することで、初めて改善につながります。<\/p><p>Flowは、計測データと運用データをもとに、<br\/>店舗の意思決定を支援することに特化しています。<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["item_cHEGLy","item_KCwfeG","item_C6DPXx","item_cf6HbK","item_4Xf6eC"],"name":"FAQ","settings":{"full_width":false,"subheading":"FAQ","title":"Flow導入に関するご質問","content":"","team_avatar_width":80,"support_hours":"計測だけでなく、活用を前提とした設計をご提案します。店舗ごとの条件に応じて最適化します。","answer_time":"","button_text":"","button_url":"","text_position":"end","background":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","background_gradient":"","text_color":"#1a1a1a","heading_color":"","heading_gradient":"","button_background":"#1a1a1a","button_text_color":"#a0b842","accordion_background":"#ffffff","accordion_text_color":""}},"contact_zLETyk":{"type":"contact","blocks":{"dropdown_FQGn7E":{"type":"dropdown","settings":{"title":"ご担当者の役職（必須）","values":"経営層,本部営業／運営,DX／情報システム,エリアマネージャー,店長,その他"}},"dropdown_BMtUcm":{"type":"dropdown","settings":{"title":"現在の主な課題（必須）","values":"来店客数の把握,コンバージョン改善,店舗間比較,スタッフ配置最適化,データ活用体制の構築,その他"}},"dropdown_d3GGrQ":{"type":"dropdown","settings":{"title":"店舗数（必須）","values":"1–5店舗,6–20店舗,21–50店舗,51–100店舗,100店舗以上"}}},"block_order":["dropdown_FQGn7E","dropdown_BMtUcm","dropdown_d3GGrQ"],"name":"Contact form","settings":{"full_width":false,"subheading":"お問い合わせ","title":"まずは、店舗の現状を把握しませんか。","content":"<p>来店・通行・行動の実態を確認することから、改善は始まります。<\/p>","text_position":"start","contact_form_size":"large","background":"#ffffff","background_gradient":"","text_color":"","heading_color":"","heading_gradient":"linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(160, 184, 66, 1), rgba(26, 26, 26, 1) 100%)","contact_background":"#f0f0f0","contact_text_color":"#000000","button_background":"","button_text_color":"#a0b842"}},"multi_column_L8rENy":{"type":"multi-column","blocks":{"item_qkEqfb":{"type":"item","settings":{"show_controls":false,"column_size":"4","title":"高可用基盤設計","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>FIDAクラウド上で冗長化構成を採用。安定稼働を実現。。<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}},"item_kieKXq":{"type":"item","settings":{"show_controls":false,"column_size":"4","title":"スケーラブル設計","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>1店舗から数百店舗まで、<br\/>構成変更なしで拡張可能<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}},"item_iptgpM":{"type":"item","settings":{"show_controls":false,"column_size":"4","title":"API \/ システム連携","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>POS・基幹・SOP・天候・外部データと柔軟に連携。<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}},"item_AgUNRa":{"type":"item","settings":{"show_controls":false,"column_size":"4","title":"データセキュリティ","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>アクセス制御・暗号化・監査ログ標準搭載。企業向け設計。<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}}},"block_order":["item_qkEqfb","item_kieKXq","item_iptgpM","item_AgUNRa"],"disabled":true,"name":"Multi-column","settings":{"full_width":true,"stack_on_mobile":true,"gap":"medium","text_alignment":"start","subheading":"","title":"エンタープライズ水準の基盤設計","content":"<p>多店舗展開を前提に設計された、安定性・拡張性・セキュリティ。<\/p>","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}},"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"content_width":"80ch"}},"image_with_text_overlay_4FrbBQ":{"type":"image-with-text-overlay","blocks":{"subheading_cpLm77":{"type":"subheading","disabled":true,"settings":{"text":"Subheading"}},"heading_3M3qnJ":{"type":"heading","disabled":true,"settings":{"text":"Image with text overlay","heading_tag":"h1"}},"richtext_7hxgGB":{"type":"richtext","disabled":true,"settings":{"content":"<p>Use this text to share information about your brand with your customers. Describe a product, share announcements, or welcome customers to your store.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["subheading_cpLm77","heading_3M3qnJ","richtext_7hxgGB"],"disabled":true,"name":"Image with text overlay","settings":{"full_width":true,"allow_transparent_header":false,"enable_parallax":true,"image_size":"md","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Platform_Image_3200x1600px.jpg","mobile_text_position":"place-self-center text-center","desktop_text_position":"sm:place-self-center sm:text-center","text_color":"#ffffff","overlay_color":"#000000","overlay_opacity":30}},"multi_column_iPQptJ":{"type":"multi-column","blocks":{"item_ahR3xN":{"type":"item","settings":{"show_controls":false,"column_size":"2","title":"導入プロセス","heading_tag":"h3","content":"<h5>01. 要件整理（シンプル）<\/h5><p>現在利用中のPOS・人事・在庫形式を確認。<br\/>既存CSVに合わせることも、Flow標準形式の利用も可能。<br\/>原則、特別な開発は不要。<\/p><h5>02. データ接続<\/h5><p>APIまたはFTP（CSV）連携に対応。<br\/>接続状況は管理画面から直接確認・管理可能。<\/p><h5>03. 初期環境構築<\/h5><p>契約後すぐに管理画面を提供。<br\/>店舗・ユーザー設定を進めながら数値整合性を確認。<br\/>既存業務を止めません。<\/p><h5>04. 段階導入（推奨）<\/h5><p>3〜5店舗・同一エリア配下での導入を推奨。<br\/>学習効果を最大化し、成功モデルを確立。<\/p><h5>05. 全社展開<\/h5><p>エリア単位で成果確認後、本部基準を統一し全店舗へ展開。<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}},"item_AeBDja":{"type":"item","settings":{"show_controls":false,"column_size":"2","title":"技術仕様ハイライト","heading_tag":"h3","content":"<h5>■ 更新頻度<\/h5><p>リアルタイム更新可能。<br\/>標準は1時間単位。10分更新にも対応。<\/p><h5>■ 対応スケール<\/h5><p>1000店舗規模まで拡張可能。<br\/>多店舗チェーンでの運用実績あり。<\/p><h5>■ データ保持<\/h5><p>長期トレンド分析に対応。<br\/>過去データのインポートも可能。<\/p><h5>■ システム設計<\/h5><p>クラウドベース／高可用性構成。<br\/>店舗数増加にも柔軟対応。<\/p><h5>■ セキュリティ<\/h5><p>アクセス制御<br\/>ログ管理<br\/>データ暗号化<br\/>SSO対応<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}},"item_EywArQ":{"type":"item","disabled":true,"settings":{"show_controls":false,"column_size":"3","title":"Column title","heading_tag":"h4","content":"<p>Pair text with an image to focus on your chosen product, collection, or blog post. Add details on availability, style, or even provide a review.<\/p>","link_url":"","link_text":"","link_style":"link"}}},"block_order":["item_ahR3xN","item_AeBDja","item_EywArQ"],"disabled":true,"name":"Multi-column","settings":{"full_width":true,"stack_on_mobile":false,"gap":"medium","text_alignment":"start","subheading":"","title":"導入プロセスとスケーラビリティ","content":"<p>既存環境を活かしながら、段階的に導入可能。<br\/>多店舗チェーンの拡張にも耐える設計です。<\/p>","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}},"rich_text_xNbfkE":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"subheading_pPN4GR":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":"- - -"}},"heading_Dj3qJR":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"すべての意思決定は、正確な基盤から。","heading_tag":"h1","text_color":"","gradient":""}},"richtext_aUgUgm":{"type":"richtext","settings":{"content":"<p>Flowは、店舗運営の「分析ツール」ではありません。本部と現場を同じ基準でつなぐ、意思決定の基盤です。<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["subheading_pPN4GR","heading_Dj3qJR","richtext_aUgUgm"],"disabled":true,"name":"Rich text","settings":{"full_width":true,"content_width":"large","text_position":"center","background":"","background_gradient":"","text_color":""}}},"order":["slideshow_XazT4w","rich_text_9wyNr6","text_with_icons_FDLVaz","hot_spots_jHjeen","rich_text_haqMr3","multiple_images_with_text_CnH68e","comparison_table_YMcB7K","rich_text_cwEqbJ","text_with_icons_Txjnk8","text_with_icons_FewhbX","multiple_images_with_text_